{"t":"Sinatuki","s":"sinatuki-a6e0c","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Sinatuki</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGrimlund\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subarea\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Subarea</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Grimlund\">Grimlund</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145837&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32426,31085,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32426, 31085, 7)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Female</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Chakoya</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown Occupation</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.00<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230824232439&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sinatuki_8fcb8e.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Sinatuki.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>South-eastern <a href=\"#/wiki/Grimlund\">Grimlund</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>A <a href=\"#/wiki/Chakoya%20Windcaller\">Chakoya Windcaller</a> who is forced to live outside <a href=\"#/wiki/Inukaya\">Inukaya</a>. Apparently, she is <a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">hungry</a> and eats all of your <a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Trout\">Rainbow Trouts</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Perch\">Green Perches</a> when you talk to her in the Chakoya Language, if you are carrying these sorts of fish.<br/>\nPart of the <a href=\"#/quest/sinatuki-quest\">Sinatuki Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Sinatuki.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi/hello</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Sajoq, jinuma!<br/>\nPlayer: <b>sajoq</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Sajoq, <i>Player</i>!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>sajoq</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Sajoq! &lt;giggles&gt;<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>jinuma</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Su gura jinuma. Si gura chakoya. &lt;first points at you then at herself&gt;<br/>\nPlayer: <i><b>Player</b></i><br/>\nSinatuki: Ahh, su gura <i>Player</i>! Si gura Sinatuki.<br/>\nPlayer: <b>si gura <i>Player</i></b><br/>\nSinatuki: Nupi, nupi, achuq!!!! &lt;claps her hands&gt;<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>chakoya</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Nupi, Sinatuki gura chakoya!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Sinatuki</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Nupi, si gura Sinatuki! Sinatuki jusipa! Jusipa!! &lt;holds her belly and points with her hand at her mouth&gt;<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>jusipa</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Nupi, nupi!! Tiyopa Sinatuki chuqua! Chuqua, chuqua!!!! &lt;points with her hand at her mouth&gt;<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>tiyopa</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Nupi, tiyopa chuqua pa Sinatuki!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>chuqua</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Chuqua jamjam!! Tiyopa Sinatuki?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>jamjam</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Nupi, nupi! Sinatuki gura jusipa! Jinuma ji chuqua pa Sinatuki??<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>nupi</b><br/>\n<i>&lt;(If you have ordinary fish:)&gt;</i><br/>\nSinatuki: &lt;wrinkles her nose, tries what you brought to her and spits it out&gt; Yuk pa chuqua?? Tiyopa taluka chuqua!<br/>\n<i>&lt;(If you have <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Perch\">Green Perch</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Trout\">Rainbow Trout</a>:)&gt;</i><br/>\nSinatuki: Jinuma, suvituka siq chuqua!! Nguraka, nguraka! &lt;happily takes the food from you&gt;<br/>\n<i>&lt;(If you do not have anything:)&gt;</i><br/>\nSinatuki: Juk?? Jinuma ji quata chuqua! &lt;seems to be confused&gt;<br/>\nPlayer: <b>jamjam</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Nupi, nupi! Sinatuki gura jusipa! Jinuma ji chuqua pa Sinatuki??<br/>\nPlayer: <b>no</b><br/>\nSinatuki: &lt;shakes her head&gt; Quata? Ohhh!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>taluka</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Yuk taluka?? Chuqua? Ahhh! &lt;drives her wand against the floor and makes a gesture like pulling something out of the ground&gt;<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>nguraka</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Kisavuta! &lt;giggles&gt;<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>kisavuta</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Nguraka! &lt;giggles&gt;<br/>\nPlayer: <b>gukaju</b>/<b>bye</b><br/>\nSinatuki: Gukaju, jinuma!<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Sinatuki</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["sinatuki-quest"],"pos":{"x":32426,"y":31085,"z":7}}